<title>DENMARK: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>DENMARK GOVERNMENT LIST (961230)</p>
<p> Head of State..............................Queen MARGRETHE II</p>
<p>			     - - - - - -</p>
<p>SOCIAL DEMOCRAT-LED COALITION GOVERNMENT</p>
<p>(Formed 27 September 94, reshuffled 30 Dec 96))</p>
<p>(For party affiliations see end of list)</p>
<p> Prime Minister......................Poul Nyrup RASMUSSEN (SD)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS: (NOTE:MINISTERS LISTED IN ORDER OF RANK)</p>
